 @startuml
skinparam style strictuml
actor User
participant "Android UI" as UI
participant "Meal Plan\nGenerator" as AI_Gen
participant "Local Database\n(Room/SQLite)" as DB
participant "GenAI API\n(External)" as LLM

User -> UI: Request Weekly Meal Plan
activate UI

UI -> AI_Gen: generateMealPlan(userId)
activate AI_Gen

AI_Gen -> DB: fetchProfileConstraints(userId)
activate DB
DB --> AI_Gen: return (DietaryReqs, AvailableIngredients)
deactivate DB

note right of AI_Gen: Construct strict JSON prompt\nenforcing user constraints\n(e.g., Vegan, use Available Ingredients)

AI_Gen -> LLM: HTTP POST /v1/models/gemini-1.5:generateContent
activate LLM
LLM --> AI_Gen: return Raw JSON Response
deactivate LLM

note right of AI_Gen: Parse and validate JSON structure.\nCatch JSONDecodeError if hallucinated.

AI_Gen -> DB: saveGeneratedMealPlan(json_data)
activate DB
DB --> AI_Gen: confirm save
deactivate DB

AI_Gen --> UI: return formatted MealPlan Object
deactivate AI_Gen

UI --> User: Display Weekly Meal Plan
deactivate UI
@enduml
